{"bankId":"B-SRC-35-2385","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0005","constructFamily":"ratio_total_from_difference","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Nisbah bilangan buku cerita kepada buku sains ialah 7:4. Bilangan buku cerita melebihi buku sains sebanyak 21 buah. Berapakah jumlah kedua-dua jenis buku?","options":["77","63","70","84"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Perbezaan bahagian = 7 − 4 = 3 bahagian = 21.","Satu bahagian = 21 ÷ 3 = 7.","Jumlah = (7 + 4) × 7 = 77."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-35-2386","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0006","constructFamily":"median_after_two_values_added","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan 8, 11, 14, 17 dan 20. Dua nilai baharu, 9 dan 18, ditambah. Berapakah median data baharu?","options":["11","14","15","17"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Susun data: 8, 9, 11, 14, 17, 18, 20.","Terdapat 7 nilai, jadi median ialah nilai ke-4.","Median = 14."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[8,11,14,17,20]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-35-2387","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0007","constructFamily":"triangle_perimeter_equal_sides","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah segi tiga sama kaki mempunyai dua sisi sama panjang 13 cm dan tapak 10 cm. Berapakah perimeternya?","options":["33 cm","39 cm","36 cm","46 cm"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Perimeter = 13 + 13 + 10.","Jumlah = 36 cm."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-35-2388","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"rectangle_area_after_scale_length","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan sebuah segi empat tepat 12 cm × 8 cm. Panjangnya digandakan tetapi lebarnya kekal. Berapakah luas baharu?","options":["96 cm²","160 cm²","384 cm²","192 cm²"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Panjang baharu = 12 × 2 = 24 cm.","Luas baharu = 24 × 8 = 192 cm²."],"visual":{"kind":"rectangle","length_cm":12,"width_cm":8}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-35-2389","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0009","constructFamily":"cuboid_fraction_to_cups_with_remainder","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah bekas kuboid berukuran 25 cm × 20 cm × 12 cm diisi sehingga 80% penuh. Air itu dituangkan ke dalam cawan 250 mL. Berapakah bilangan cawan penuh dan baki air?","options":["19 cawan, baki 50 mL","18 cawan, baki 300 mL","20 cawan, baki 0 mL","19 cawan, baki 100 mL"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Isi padu penuh = 25 × 20 × 12 = 6000 cm³ = 6000 mL.","80% × 6000 = 4800 mL.","4800 ÷ 250 = 19 baki 50 mL."],"visual":{"kind":"cuboid","length_cm":25,"width_cm":20,"height_cm":12}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-35-2390","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0010","constructFamily":"timetable_equal_intervals_count","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Sebuah bas mula beroperasi pada 7:10 pagi dan bertolak setiap 25 minit. Jika bas pertama bertolak pada 7:10 pagi, pada pukul berapakah bas kelima bertolak?","options":["8:35 pagi","8:50 pagi","9:00 pagi","9:15 pagi"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Bas kelima berlaku selepas 4 sela masa.","4 × 25 minit = 100 minit = 1 jam 40 minit.","7:10 pagi + 1 jam 40 minit = 8:50 pagi."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-35-2391","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0011","constructFamily":"best_value_two_pack_sizes","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Kedai A menjual 6 botol air pada RM15.60. Kedai B menjual 8 botol pada RM20.00. Kedai manakah lebih murah bagi setiap botol dan berapa beza harga sebotol?","options":["Kedai A, lebih murah RM0.10","Kedai A, lebih murah RM0.20","Kedai B, lebih murah RM0.10","Kedai B, lebih murah RM0.20"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Kedai A: RM15.60 ÷ 6 = RM2.60 sebotol.","Kedai B: RM20.00 ÷ 8 = RM2.50 sebotol.","Kedai B lebih murah RM0.10 sebotol."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-35-2392","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0012","constructFamily":"mean_after_all_values_doubled","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan 6, 8, 10, 12 dan 14. Jika setiap nilai digandakan, berapakah min baharu?","options":["10","18","22","20"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Min asal = (6 + 8 + 10 + 12 + 14) ÷ 5 = 10.","Apabila setiap nilai digandakan, min juga digandakan.","Min baharu = 20."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[6,8,10,12,14]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-35-2393","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0001","constructFamily":"exterior_angle_remote_ratio","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sudut luar sebuah segi tiga ialah 132°. Dua sudut dalam bertentangan mempunyai nisbah 5:6. Berapakah sudut dalam bertentangan yang lebih besar?","options":["72°","60°","66°","78°"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Dua sudut dalam bertentangan berjumlah 132°.","Jumlah bahagian = 5 + 6 = 11, jadi 1 bahagian = 132° ÷ 11 = 12°.","Sudut lebih besar = 6 × 12° = 72°."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-35-2394","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0013","constructFamily":"coordinate_rectangle_horizontal_length","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Pada grid, A=(2,5) dan B=(9,5). Jika 1 unit mewakili 300 m, berapakah jarak sebenar AB?","options":["1.8 km","2.1 km","2.4 km","2.7 km"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jarak mengufuk = 9 − 2 = 7 unit.","7 × 300 m = 2100 m = 2.1 km."],"visual":{"kind":"coordinate_move","start":[2,5],"move_right":7}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-36-2451","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0002","constructFamily":"lcm_two_repeating_events","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Loceng A berbunyi setiap 6 minit dan loceng B setiap 8 minit. Kedua-duanya berbunyi bersama pada 9:00 pagi. Selepas berapa minit kedua-duanya akan berbunyi bersama lagi?","options":["12 minit","18 minit","24 minit","48 minit"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Gandaan 6: 6, 12, 18, 24, ...","Gandaan 8: 8, 16, 24, ...","Gandaan sepunya terkecil ialah 24 minit."]}
